option.AMBIENT_BASE = Minimum Ambient Light
option.AMBIENT_BASE.comment = A small guaranteed light level added to every surface, so unlit caves and the deepest shadows keep a hint of visibility instead of pure black. 0 = fully realistic darkness.
option.TORCH_BRIGHTNESS = Torch Brightness
option.TORCH_BRIGHTNESS.comment = Brightness of torches, lanterns and other warm artificial lights. The warm color stays the same.
option.STAR_MAP_INTENSITY = Star Brightness
option.STAR_MAP_INTENSITY.comment = Brightness of the night sky's stars (a real NASA star map). 0 = starless sky.
option.ATM_HORIZON_DIP = Horizon Below-Dip
option.ATM_HORIZON_DIP.comment = Thickens the haze band at the horizon by extending the atmosphere below the ground line, so distant terrain melts into a denser, more realistic horizon haze.
value.ATM_HORIZON_DIP.0 = Off
value.ATM_HORIZON_DIP.1 = On
option.ATM_HORIZON_DIP_SCALE = Below-Dip Scale
option.ATM_HORIZON_DIP_SCALE.comment = How deep that horizon atmosphere reaches: higher = thicker horizon haze.
